<surname>Parker</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The antiestrogen ICI 182780 disrupts estrogen receptor nucleocytoplasmic shuttling</article-title><source>J Cell Sci</source><year>1993</year><volume>106</volume><fpage>1377</fpage><lpage>1388</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8126115</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Osborne</surname><given-names>CK</given-names></name><name><surname>Coronado-Heinsohn</surname><given-names>EB</given-names></name><name><surname>Hilsenbeck</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>McCue</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wakeling</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>McClelland</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Manning</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicholson</surname><given-names>RI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparison of the effects of a pure steroidal antiestrogen with those of tamoxifen in a model of human breast cancer</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1995</year><volume>87</volume><fpage>746</fpage><lpage>750</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7563152</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/jnci/87.10.746</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perey</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Paridaens</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hawle</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Zaman</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nol&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Wildiers</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Fiche</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dietrich</surname><given-names>D</given-na